---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { btnPlan } from "../lib/links";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="FFL Search Console: The 2A Layer for Google Search Console | Coriolis"
  description="FFL Search Console is being built to show what shoppers searched for on your gun store's website alongside the Google Search Console reports you already use."
  path="/ffl-search-console"
>
  <section class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl"
      >
        The 2A layer for Google Search Console users
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
        Google Search Console shows how people find you on Google. FFL Search
        Console is being built to show what shoppers searched for on your
        website, alongside the reports you already use.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">
        Free today, in your Gun Search Engine dealer account
      </h2>
      <ul
        class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300"
      >
        <li>What shoppers searched for on your website</li>
        <li>Which of those searches found nothing</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
        These reports live in the analytics area of a free Gun Search Engine
        dealer account today. FFL Search Console is being built to show them
        alongside Google Search Console.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
        Designed to work alongside Google Search Console, not replace it.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Pro</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
          Free through December 31, 2026.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300"
        >
          <li>Monthly Demand Intelligence reports</li>
          <li>
            More Pro features are on the way, including FFL Search Console
            features as they ship.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <a
        href="https://gunsearchengine.com/dealers/register?utm_source=coriolisagency&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=ffl-search-console&ref=coriolis-ffl-search-console"
        class={`${btnPlan} mt-8`}
      >
        Create a free dealer account
      </a>

      <p class="mt-8 text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">
        Not affiliated with Google. Google Search Console is a trademark of Google LLC.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
